{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 584355, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 117182, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "3.02 火Raid攻略", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1676989013, "updated_at": 1677907828, "updated_uid": 63428, "comment_at": 1692591700, "last_at": 1692614053, "comment_count": 270, "status": 1, "summary": "本期Boss难点在于T技能和S技能提供高频率的DoT伤害，并且因为有DoT增伤Buff的存在，伤害会非常高，你不带解状态角色很可能会被烫死。且热伤+乱舞之刃的双重破防效果，会让你受到的物理伤害大幅度提", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1544/h_7719/202/63428/2023/1/28/785030.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1175/h_2995/202/63428/2023/1/28/215708.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1336/h_2613/202/63428/2023/1/28/96870.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 31, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 63240, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "江西省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 5, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 584355, "content": "<div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"Boss技能分析\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"400\" data-height=\"299\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_400/h_299/202/63428/2023/1/21/263240.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_400/h_299/202/63428/2023/1/21/263240.jpg\"></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div>本期Boss难点在于<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">T技能和S技能提供高频率的DoT伤害</span>，并且因为有DoT增伤Buff的存在，伤害会非常高，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">你不带解状态角色很可能会被烫死</span>。</div><div>且<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">热伤+乱舞之刃的双重破防效果</span>，会让你受到的<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">物理伤害大幅度提高</span>，低防御单位可能会被Boss一个大招砸死。</div><div><br></div><div>Boss还带有15层加速效果（每受到1次攻击减少1层），我们要<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">尽可能快地<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">破掉Boss身上的加速</span></span>，不能让加速一直挂在Boss身上，这样才能避免乱舞和热伤在你身上叠加。</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">对此，我们的对策是：</span></div><div>1.<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">必须带解Debuff角色</span>，比如水罗刹，秋牡丹，木莫娜，这一类角色可以清除队友身上的DoT效果，为队伍提供生存保障。</div><div><br></div><div>2.<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">队伍需要保证加速幅度</span>，太低的加速意味着技能频率不够高，技能频率一旦太低，Boss加速解不掉，等待你的只有灭队。</div></span><div></div></span><div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"Raid对策分析\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div>本期Raid对策为复合型辅助，附带非常夸张的充能+冷缩缩减效果，T技能附带满充效果，且T和DS都提供回血效果，队伍生存能力有保障，唯一的加攻效果是大招提供的呐喊buff，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">整体下来强度不错，属于Raid辅助中的多面手。</span></div><div><br></div><div>建议：<span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-decoration-line: underline; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">点火4红→点火6红→抽到+3→抽到+6</span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(187, 0, 0);\">按照上述顺序进行投资，点火优先，加值以求加速超过阿罗汉为主</span></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">详细评价</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1544\" data-height=\"7719\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1544/h_7719/202/63428/2023/1/28/785030.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1544/h_7719/202/63428/2023/1/28/785030.png\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div></span><div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n           